WEBVTT

00:00:13.444 --> 00:00:14.706
[SNIFFLES]

00:00:17.187 --> 00:00:18.797
It's not safe here.

00:00:20.842 --> 00:00:22.453
I'll tell her.

00:00:24.629 --> 00:00:25.760
[SOBS]

00:00:34.987 --> 00:00:36.293
[CONTINUES SOBBING]

00:00:41.036 --> 00:00:42.212
[PLAYS LOW NOTE]

00:00:53.527 --> 00:00:55.268
[ALL PLAYING]

00:01:10.631 --> 00:01:12.372
I never got
to tell him.

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:14.418
[SOBBING]

00:01:14.461 --> 00:01:17.638
Eep, if your dad were here,
he would tell you to--

00:01:17.682 --> 00:01:20.859
GRUG: Get out of the way!

00:01:20.902 --> 00:01:23.209
Wow. You sound
just like him.

00:01:23.253 --> 00:01:27.213
GRUG: Get out of the way!

00:01:27.257 --> 00:01:28.475
Dadda!

00:01:28.519 --> 00:01:29.868
He did it!

00:01:29.911 --> 00:01:31.391
He's riding the sun.

00:01:31.435 --> 00:01:32.697
[GRUG YELLS]

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:34.699
But, not very well.

00:01:34.742 --> 00:01:36.918
Everybody
out of the way!

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:39.921
[GRUG GRUNTS]

00:01:42.141 --> 00:01:44.491
Dad!
Grug!

00:01:44.535 --> 00:01:46.493
Where's the danger?
Who blew their shell?

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.236
I love you, too!

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:53.413
[SIGHS]

00:01:59.289 --> 00:02:02.335
One, two,
three, four...

00:02:02.379 --> 00:02:04.076
five...

00:02:04.119 --> 00:02:05.120
six...

00:02:06.209 --> 00:02:08.254
and seven.

00:02:08.298 --> 00:02:09.473
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:09.516 --> 00:02:10.778
[CHITTERS]

00:02:10.822 --> 00:02:12.084
And a half.

00:02:13.303 --> 00:02:14.826
And eight.
[SIGHS]

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:16.871
Nine.

00:02:16.915 --> 00:02:19.178
Douglas! Dad,
you saved him!

00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:21.615
A boy has to have a pet.

00:02:21.659 --> 00:02:22.921
[PURRS]

00:02:22.964 --> 00:02:24.227
[BOTH SCREAM]

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.231
Turns out
I'm a cat person.

00:02:28.883 --> 00:02:30.711
[PURRING]
Uh-uh!

00:02:30.755 --> 00:02:31.930
No.

00:02:35.107 --> 00:02:36.587
[BOTH CHITTERING]

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.371
Ah!
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:40.982 --> 00:02:44.247
You really need
to see this.

00:02:56.128 --> 00:02:58.304
We should go there.
[BARKS]

00:02:58.348 --> 00:03:00.437
Yes!
Coming through!

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.655
[ALL LAUGHING]

00:03:02.656 --> 00:03:03.831
GUY: Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:04.876
Wait!

00:03:09.315 --> 00:03:12.362
This is me.
My name is Eep.

00:03:12.405 --> 00:03:15.756
And this is my family,
the Croods.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:18.324
If you weren't clued in
by the suntans and pets...

00:03:18.368 --> 00:03:21.022
we're not exactly
cavemen anymore.

00:03:21.849 --> 00:03:23.198
[ALL GRUNT]

00:03:23.242 --> 00:03:24.417
[CHUCKLES]

00:03:24.461 --> 00:03:27.638
Oh, let's do it again.
I think I blinked.

00:03:27.681 --> 00:03:30.597
EEP: Our world is still
plenty harsh and hostile...

00:03:30.641 --> 00:03:32.077
[SNARLS]
[CHUCKLES]

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.297
but now we know
the Croods will make it.

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:37.212
Because we changed
the rules...

00:03:37.256 --> 00:03:39.171
the ones that
kept us in the dark.

00:03:39.214 --> 00:03:40.346
[GRUNTS]

00:03:41.478 --> 00:03:43.393
[PLAYS LOW NOTE]

00:03:43.436 --> 00:03:46.178
And because of my dad,
who taught us that
anyone can change.

00:03:46.221 --> 00:03:47.875
Release the baby!

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.531
[COOS]
[BARKS]

00:03:53.185 --> 00:03:54.578
EEP: Sort of.

00:03:54.621 --> 00:03:55.666
[THUNK GASPS]

00:03:55.709 --> 00:03:56.884
[YELPING]

00:04:07.068 --> 00:04:08.374
Ha-ha!

00:04:13.379 --> 00:04:16.774
So, from now on,
we'll stay out here...

00:04:16.817 --> 00:04:18.906
where we can
follow the light.

00:04:28.394 --> 00:04:29.482
[SANDY GIGGLES]

00:04:30.396 --> 00:04:31.571
[PANTING]

00:04:31.615 --> 00:04:32.964
BOTH: Dun-dun-dun!

00:04:33.704 --> 00:04:35.270
[GIGGLING]
[CHITTERS]

00:04:38.143 --> 00:04:40.711
[SHINE YOUR WAYPLAYING]

00:04:44.454 --> 00:04:48.719
MAN: ♪ Just before the dawn
When the light's still gone

00:04:48.762 --> 00:04:52.549
♪ Shine, shine your way

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:56.683
♪ And you may not know
where to go

00:04:56.727 --> 00:05:01.035
♪ To shine, shine your way

00:05:01.079 --> 00:05:04.909
BOTH: ♪ Open road
but it's still dark
Build a fire from a spark

00:05:04.952 --> 00:05:08.478
♪ Shine, shine your way

00:05:08.521 --> 00:05:10.915
♪ Feed the feeling
in your heart

00:05:10.958 --> 00:05:13.047
♪ Don't conceal it
then you'll start

00:05:13.091 --> 00:05:17.051
♪ To find, find your way

00:05:17.095 --> 00:05:21.099
WOMAN: ♪ No one
can stop what has begun

00:05:21.142 --> 00:05:25.059
♪ You must believe when I say

00:05:25.103 --> 00:05:31.065
BOTH: ♪ All of your tears
will dry faster in the sun

00:05:31.109 --> 00:05:36.331
♪ Starting today
Shine, shine, shine

00:05:36.375 --> 00:05:39.465
♪ Shine your way

00:05:44.601 --> 00:05:48.605
WOMAN: ♪ There's an open sky
and a reason why

00:05:48.648 --> 00:05:52.609
♪ You shine, shine your way

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:56.569
♪ There's so much to learn
And now it's your turn

00:05:56.613 --> 00:06:01.139
♪ To shine, shine your way

00:06:01.182 --> 00:06:03.054
BOTH: ♪ There's
a feeling deep inside

00:06:03.097 --> 00:06:04.751
♪ You can let it
be your guide

00:06:04.795 --> 00:06:08.494
♪ To find, find your way

00:06:08.538 --> 00:06:11.018
♪ And there's no time
for us to waste

00:06:11.062 --> 00:06:13.064
♪ Got to take a leap of faith

00:06:13.107 --> 00:06:17.068
♪ And fly, fly away

00:06:17.111 --> 00:06:21.159
WOMAN: ♪ Don't have to walk
Now you can run

00:06:21.202 --> 00:06:24.989
♪ Nothing can
get in your way

00:06:25.032 --> 00:06:31.082
BOTH: ♪ All of your tears
will dry faster in the sun

00:06:31.125 --> 00:06:36.522
♪ Starting today
Shine, shine, shine

00:06:36.566 --> 00:06:39.569
♪ Shine your way

